// The kind-mix wall over an EXPRESSION literal (the decl-form twin is
// tests/testvalueinitkeyedmix.mad): the carrier's kinds keep keyed and
// indexed members apart, so a literal mixing a string KEY with a
// positional element refuses at COMPILE time — through the same
// carrier_list_elements wall the declaration literal runs.
int main()
{
	var rows;
	rows[] = { 1, "k": 2 };
	return 0;
}
